{
    "$comment": [
        "标签演示板（A7）：一个竖排容器，里面放 CXXCSS/Label/*.json 那几个标签。",
        "它同时是 A6 那条「label 按文字自己撑高」的现场：容器只声明规则（一列、",
        "间距 10、内缩 16、交叉轴拉满），高度由每个标签自己报（MeasureLayout）——",
        "没有任何一处手算 offsetY。",
        "被 examples/panel_demo 使用：按 L 键（或点「中/EN」按钮）切语言时，",
        "这里会整体换字并重新排版（标签的排版缓存键里带着语言版本号）。"
    ],
    "name": "labelBoard",
    "width": 400,
    "height": 250,

    "closed": {
        "type": "color",
        "source": "$panelSurface"
    },
    "clipChildren": true,

    "selfAnchorX": 0, "selfAnchorY": 0,
    "traceAnchorX": 0, "traceAnchorY": 0,
    "offsetX": 420, "offsetY": 40,

    "zIndex": 1,
    "visible": true,

    "shape": { "type": "roundedRect", "radius": 14 },

    "layout": {
        "kind": "stack",
        "axis": "vertical",
        "gap": 10,
        "padding": 16,
        "justify": "start",
        "align": "stretch"
    }
}
